/span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:36.690">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.720" end="00:38.880"><span begin="00:36.720" end="00:37.050">Well </span><span begin="00:37.050" end="00:37.080">I </span><span begin="00:37.080" end="00:37.350">think </span><span begin="00:37.350" end="00:37.470">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.680">gonna </span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:37.920">burn </span><span begin="00:37.920" end="00:38.130">in </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:38.880">hell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.120" end="00:40.890"><span begin="00:39.120" end="00:39.690">Everybody </span><span begin="00:39.690" end="00:39.900">burn </span><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:39.960">the </span><span begin="00:39.960" end="00:40.320">house </span><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.530">right </span><span begin="00:40.530" end="00:40.890">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.890" end="00:42.120"><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.040">And </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.700">say </span><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:42.120">ha</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.120" end="00:44.160"><span begin="00:42.120" end="00:42.450">What </span><span begin="00:42.450" end="00:42.570">I </span><span begin="00:42.570" end="00:43.500">wanna </span><span begin="00:43.500" end="00:44.160">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.340" end="00:46.590"><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.670">Tell </span><span begin="00:44.670" end="00:45.030">me </span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.270">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.270" end="00:45.540">an </span><span begin="00:45.540" end="00:46.590">angel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.620" end="00:48.840"><span begin="00:46.620" end="00:47.040">Take </span><span begin="00:47.040" end="00:47.340">this </span><span begin="00:47.340" end="00:47.490">to </span><span begin="00:47.490" end="00:47.670">my </span><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:48.840">grave</span></p><p ttm:ag