span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.820" end="01:26.400"><span begin="01:23.820" end="01:23.940">We </span><span begin="01:23.940" end="01:24.270">got </span><span begin="01:24.270" end="01:25.050">innocence </span><span begin="01:25.050" end="01:25.170">for </span><span begin="01:25.170" end="01:26.400">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.610" end="01:28.680"><span begin="01:26.610" end="01:26.880">Well </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.000">I </span><span begin="01:27.000" end="01:27.270">think </span><span begin="01:27.270" end="01:27.390">I'm </span><span begin="01:27.390" end="01:27.570">gonna </span><span begin="01:27.570" end="01:27.840">burn </span><span begin="01:27.840" end="01:27.990">in </span><span begin="01:27.990" end="01:28.680">hell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.010" end="01:30.810"><span begin="01:29.010" end="01:29.610">Everybody </span><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:29.820">burn </span><span begin="01:29.820" end="01:29.880">the </span><span begin="01:29.880" end="01:30.210">house </span><span begin="01:30.210" end="01:30.450">right </span><span begin="01:30.450" end="01:30.810">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.810" end="01:32.040"><span begin="01:30.810" end="01:30.960">And </span><span begin="01:30.960" end="01:31.590">say </span><span begin="01:31.590" end="01:32.040">ha</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.040" end="01:34.230"><span begin="01:32.040" end="01:32.370">What </span><span begin="01:32.370" end="01:32.460">I </span><span begin="01:32.460" end="01:33.420">wanna </span><span begin="01:33.420" end="01:34.230">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.260" end="01:36.480"><span begin="01:34.260" end="01:34.560">Tell </span><span begin="01:34.560" end="01:34.920">me </span><span begin="01:34.920" end="01:35.190">I'm </span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:35.430">an </span><span begin="01:35.430" end="01:36.480">angel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.510" end="01:38.730"><span